{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "description": "DORA engineering performance metrics. Import at http://grafana.local/dashboard/import",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 30,
      "title": "DORA Metrics",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "How often ClearLedger deploys to production. Elite: multiple per day. High: once per day. Medium: once per week. Low: once per month.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "No deployments",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0.1,
                "to": 0.9,
                "result": {
                  "text": "Low performer",
                  "color": "yellow"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 1,
                "to": 6.9,
                "result": {
                  "text": "Medium performer",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 7,
                "to": null,
                "result": {
                  "text": "High/Elite performer",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(argocd_app_sync_total{name=\"clearledger\",phase=\"Succeeded\"}[7d]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Deployment Frequency (7d)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Time from code push to running in production. Approximated from ArgoCD reconcile duration. Elite: < 1 hour. High: < 1 day.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 86400
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 604800
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 604800
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg(argocd_app_reconcile_duration_seconds{name=\"clearledger\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Lead Time (avg seconds)",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "% of changes that caused failures. Elite: < 5%. High: 5-10%. Low: > 15%.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(argocd_app_sync_total{name=\"clearledger\",phase=\"Failed\"}[7d])) / sum(increase(argocd_app_sync_total{name=\"clearledger\"}[7d]))) * 100",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Change Failure Rate (7d)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Average time ArgoCD takes to reconcile after a sync failure. Not true MTTR - true MTTR requires incident data (PagerDuty/Opsgenie). This shows deployment recovery speed.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 86400
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 604800
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg(argocd_app_reconcile_duration_seconds{name=\"clearledger\"}) by (name)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "MTTR Proxy (avg recovery seconds)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Successful and failed deployments over time. Each bar = one day.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Successful deploys"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed deploys"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 5,
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "increase(argocd_app_sync_total{name=\"clearledger\",phase=\"Succeeded\"}[1d])",
          "legendFormat": "Successful deploys",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "increase(argocd_app_sync_total{name=\"clearledger\",phase=\"Failed\"}[1d])",
          "legendFormat": "Failed deploys",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Deployment Activity (7d)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## What These Numbers Mean\n\n| Metric | Elite | High | Medium | Low |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Deploy Frequency | Multiple/day | Once/day | Once/week | Once/month |\n| Lead Time | < 1 hour | < 1 day | < 1 week | > 1 month |\n| Change Failure Rate | < 5% | 5-10% | 10-15% | > 15% |\n| MTTR | < 1 hour | < 1 day | < 1 week | > 1 week |\n\nSource: Google DORA State of DevOps Report 2024.\n\nClearLedger aims for **High** on all four metrics.\nIn a homelab with manual testing, **Medium** is realistic.\n\n**MTTR note:** This dashboard uses ArgoCD reconcile duration as a proxy.\nTrue MTTR requires incident timestamps from PagerDuty, Opsgenie, or similar."
      },
      "title": "What These Numbers Mean",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "tags": [
    "clearledger",
    "dora",
    "engineering"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "ClearLedger - DORA Metrics",
  "uid": "clearledger-dora-metrics",
  "version": 1,
  "slug": "clearledger-dora-metrics"
}
